I was polymorphed into a red dragon.  I layed an egg.  It hatched. I named it Red.
It was cool.  It kill shop keepers so I got their money.  I took it a few levels
down.  I stepped on a teleport trap which took me a few levels down.  I came back
to Red, only to find it didn't remember me.  I threw it food rations, tripe
rations, ect.  I died by Reds bite.  What the.......?  I thought pets could be
reaffirmed with trust by feeding them.  I guess I was wrong.

Dean



